I haven't entered the Quest with all roles but over the years I've
often read that level 14 isn't really appropriate for many roles.

For some level 14 is already too easy and for others it's not good
enough for competing with the Quest nemesis.

In vanilla it's just an artificial hoop you have to jump through.


That and Pat's posting were the reason I lowered it in UnNetHack to
level 10. I let the player decide if he wants to go on a quest or not.

